  "comparison": "The pinned SourceReadRequest and SourceFacts schemas equal the actual embedded schema exactly. The shared TLS listener verifies any presented cert, and the existing facts route insists on verified TLS 1.3, single Processing DNS SAN, no URI/IP SAN. Webhook relies on its checked endpoint and Stripe signature. Sender uses the Processing TLS identity and exact Receipt contract."
